*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : SHP0005
*> PURPOSE : SHIPPING CHARGES RULES
*> AUTHOR  : A.W.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-05-16 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-11-06 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 381
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB SHPNIGHT STEP030
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SHP0005.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    COPY SHP0005C.
01 OUT-RECORD.
    05 FREE-SHIP-IND      PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 DELIV-FEE          PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
    *> DELIVERY SURCHARGE
    05 SURCHG-AMT         PIC 9(4)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM 3000-FREE-SHIP
    PERFORM 3100-ZONE-SURCHG
    DISPLAY "FREE-SHIP-IND=" FREE-SHIP-IND
    DISPLAY "DELIV-FEE=" DELIV-FEE
    DISPLAY "SURCHG-AMT=" SURCHG-AMT
    STOP RUN.
3000-FREE-SHIP.
    *> FREE STANDARD SHIPPING
    IF ORD-TOTAL >= 50 AND SHIP-STANDARD
        MOVE 'Y' TO FREE-SHIP-IND
        MOVE 0.00 TO DELIV-FEE
    END-IF.
3100-ZONE-SURCHG.
    *> REMOTE ZONE SURCHARGE
    IF DEST-Z7-OR-ZR
        MOVE 10 TO SURCHG-AMT
    END-IF.
